Unlike standard armors, "Shades" features multi-layered military digital camouflage plating made from heat-resistant ceramics and carbon-fiber composites. This heavy shielding insulated the internal systems against ambient temperatures reaching thousands of degrees while confusing thermal tracking systems.

In Iron Man 3, Mark XXIII flies into action during the House Party Protocol at the Norco oil rig, engaging Extremis forces alongside the rest of the Iron Legion before being destroyed in the final "Clean Slate" detonation order.
